WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.320
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.400 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:06.080 --> 02:08.479
Goodness, I'm exhausted.

02:09.160 --> 02:10.320
Do you know?

02:10.400 --> 02:12.160
Xiao Run is really something.

02:12.760 --> 02:15.280
He posted 500 portraits of you
in the city.

02:15.360 --> 02:16.240
Five hundred…

02:18.480 --> 02:19.840
Portraits.

02:21.720 --> 02:22.840
Shangque,

02:22.920 --> 02:24.320
the servant Qu Shui, and I

02:24.400 --> 02:26.440
spent four hours taking them down.

02:27.120 --> 02:28.800
My legs are slimmer now.

02:32.800 --> 02:35.000
It was all because of your bad idea.

02:35.080 --> 02:38.080
You not only kept Xiao Run
and Xie Wanqing from meeting,

02:38.160 --> 02:39.760
but also encouraged Xiao Run

02:39.840 --> 02:41.560
with his fairy in the painting.

02:41.640 --> 02:43.440
If Xie Wanying fails her tribulation,

02:43.520 --> 02:45.040
thus ruining my plan,

02:45.120 --> 02:47.040
I will send you to Silver Lake

02:47.120 --> 02:48.360
to dig rocks and mine.

02:52.320 --> 02:54.000
Don't blame Jieli for that.

02:54.080 --> 02:57.040
It's because you are too charming.

02:57.120 --> 02:59.200
You met Lady Wanqing under the moonlight

02:59.280 --> 03:00.920
and made her fall in love with you

03:01.000 --> 03:02.200
at first sight.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.760
The fairy in the painting

03:05.840 --> 03:07.560
is exaggerating my charms.

03:08.440 --> 03:10.720
Why is her dream lover being so modest?

03:20.720 --> 03:22.600
Good things take time.

03:22.680 --> 03:25.080
Don't worry too much.

03:29.480 --> 03:30.480
Persuade the lord.

03:30.560 --> 03:32.480
Now you want to order me around?

03:33.040 --> 03:34.640
You ordered Qu Shui around

03:34.720 --> 03:35.880
and smiled at him today.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.600
Didn't you have a lot of fun?

03:37.680 --> 03:39.920
Why are you acting weirdly too?

03:40.000 --> 03:40.960
I just don't understand

03:41.040 --> 03:42.080
why you are so interested

03:42.160 --> 03:43.120
in Qu Shui.

03:43.200 --> 03:44.840
That's because his stupidity is amusing.

03:44.920 --> 03:46.640
He's a fool just like his master.

03:46.720 --> 03:49.240
You always say that I am
the stupidest person in the three realms.

03:49.320 --> 03:51.280
Can he be stupider than me?

03:52.160 --> 03:53.320
Stupid Black Dragon,

03:53.400 --> 03:55.040
if you want to be the best at something,

03:55.120 --> 03:56.360
shouldn't it be something good?

03:56.920 --> 03:57.800
That's not what I mean.

03:57.880 --> 03:58.800
Then what do you mean?

03:58.880 --> 04:00.040
- Stop arguing.
- Stop arguing.

04:13.200 --> 04:14.480
Forget it.

04:14.560 --> 04:15.600
Let's be serious.

04:15.680 --> 04:17.640
Jieli, it has been a long day.

04:17.720 --> 04:19.920
They still haven't even met each other.

04:20.000 --> 04:21.000
What should we do?

04:21.680 --> 04:22.640
I…

04:24.200 --> 04:25.440
Are you still counting on her?

04:26.000 --> 04:26.840
Forget it.

04:26.920 --> 04:29.280
In my opinion, I had better go to Xiao Run

04:29.360 --> 04:31.640
and talk to him face-to-face
to make him give up.

04:32.920 --> 04:34.280
Talk to him face-to-face?

04:37.080 --> 04:39.320
He is obsessed with you right now.

04:39.400 --> 04:41.000
If you meet him now,

04:41.760 --> 04:44.160
I'm afraid you will be married tomorrow.

04:44.920 --> 04:46.760
This won't do and that won't do.

04:46.840 --> 04:48.320
Then tell me. What should we do?

04:57.160 --> 04:58.320
I got it.

04:59.040 --> 05:01.280
Orchid, if you want to meet Xiao Run,

05:01.360 --> 05:02.480
you can.

05:04.840 --> 05:05.920
But not like this.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.120
All right.

05:17.640 --> 05:18.480
Perfect.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.560
If Xiao Run sees his desired fairy

05:21.640 --> 05:23.240
looking like this,

05:23.320 --> 05:24.600
I'm sure he will lose interest.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.080
Here, take a look.

05:30.560 --> 05:32.120
Isn't it too…

05:34.480 --> 05:35.680
No, she isn't ugly enough.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.400
I'll do it myself.

05:40.960 --> 05:42.680
Moon Supreme Lord, no need.

05:42.760 --> 05:43.760
No.

05:43.840 --> 05:45.840
Since it is to make Xiao Run give up,

05:45.920 --> 05:47.520
the uglier, the better.

05:49.840 --> 05:52.400
Changheng has become a mortal now

05:52.480 --> 05:53.840
and still likes

05:53.920 --> 05:55.640
an ordinary girl like you.

06:25.920 --> 06:28.120
My lord is really good at applying makeup.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.920
If Xiao Run takes a look at Orchid now,

06:31.000 --> 06:32.680
he will surely have nightmares.

06:34.480 --> 06:36.480
Do you remember what I said?

06:41.080 --> 06:42.920
Be as rude as I can be.

06:43.000 --> 06:44.840
Be as vulgar as I can be.

06:44.920 --> 06:46.680
After meeting Xiao Run today,

06:46.760 --> 06:49.760
I must make sure
his love for me will be gone.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.000
What is the hurry?

06:55.600 --> 06:57.280
You used to be lazy

06:57.360 --> 06:58.920
and refused to get up early.

06:59.000 --> 07:01.120
Now you're so eager to see Xiao Run.

07:02.600 --> 07:03.520
I'm just hoping

07:03.600 --> 07:05.920
he can complete his tribulation soon.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.160
Moon Supreme Lord,

07:07.240 --> 07:09.160
look at how much I'm sacrificing.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.360
Do you still not believe

07:10.440 --> 07:11.960
that I have no feelings for Xiao Run?

07:15.080 --> 07:16.120
There is no rush.

07:22.800 --> 07:24.200
Go after noon passes.

07:24.280 --> 07:26.440
Let Xiao Run wait for a long time.

07:26.520 --> 07:28.600
His impression of you will be even worse.

07:30.120 --> 07:32.560
Fine, I'll listen to you.

07:32.640 --> 07:34.000
DONGFANG MANSION

07:43.800 --> 07:45.160
Remember.

07:45.240 --> 07:47.160
Keep your distance from him when you talk.

07:47.880 --> 07:49.200
Don't look at him.

07:49.280 --> 07:50.880
Don't smile at him.

07:50.960 --> 07:52.320
Don't go to secluded places.

07:56.320 --> 07:57.960
Moon Supreme Lord,

07:58.040 --> 08:00.440
why are you so weird today?

08:00.520 --> 08:03.360
Why are you so talkative and overcautious?

08:03.440 --> 08:05.160
Are you so worried about me?

08:05.640 --> 08:07.560
You talk too much.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.160
- I'm leaving.
- Wait.

08:18.160 --> 08:19.280
What is this?

08:21.640 --> 08:22.600
Food.

08:23.880 --> 08:24.720
I'm leaving.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.200
Xiao Run.

08:53.400 --> 08:55.160
The fairy in the painting?

08:56.160 --> 08:57.240
It really is you.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.600
You really came.

08:58.680 --> 09:00.000
"Fairy in the painting"?

09:00.080 --> 09:01.320
That's so mysterious.

09:01.400 --> 09:02.480
What a stupid name.

09:02.560 --> 09:03.440
I don't like it.

09:03.520 --> 09:04.880
Also,

09:04.960 --> 09:06.120
why are you staring at me?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.800
She is acting so oddly.

09:11.840 --> 09:13.160
Maybe she is

09:14.200 --> 09:15.400
testing me.

09:17.400 --> 09:18.760
Miss, you misunderstood me.

09:18.840 --> 09:20.960
I just thought

09:21.760 --> 09:22.960
I had never seen

09:23.040 --> 09:24.760
a woman wear such an original look.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.600
This makeup is deliberately bold.

09:27.680 --> 09:28.600
And this flower crown

09:28.680 --> 09:29.720
is refreshing and elegant.

09:29.800 --> 09:31.960
I think only you,

09:32.040 --> 09:34.480
someone unworldly and elegant,

09:34.560 --> 09:35.400
can pull it off.

09:36.280 --> 09:38.280
I'm so late. Aren't you angry?

09:38.920 --> 09:40.160
Why would I be angry?

09:40.720 --> 09:42.440
You put such thought into your appearance.

09:42.520 --> 09:45.360
You must have greatly valued this meeting.

09:45.440 --> 09:47.200
Naturally, I should wait for you longer.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.440
I would wait several days,

09:48.520 --> 09:50.440
let alone half a day.

09:59.760 --> 10:02.680
Is something wrong with Xiao Run's eyes?

10:04.400 --> 10:06.320
Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.

10:17.080 --> 10:19.040
No, I'll have to go.

10:20.640 --> 10:22.680
My lord, they just met.

10:22.760 --> 10:24.440
Why don't we wait a little longer?

10:33.160 --> 10:34.040
I thought

10:34.120 --> 10:35.840
that it was just a meeting in a dream.

10:36.800 --> 10:37.720
I didn't think

10:38.320 --> 10:40.960
that I would really see you today.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.360
How dare you say that?

10:45.440 --> 10:46.320
I…

10:46.400 --> 10:48.320
I'm here to question you.

10:48.400 --> 10:50.040
Why do you have a painting of me?

10:50.120 --> 10:52.600
You even posted it all over Lucheng.

10:52.680 --> 10:54.160
It's so ugly.

10:54.240 --> 10:56.880
It didn't even show a bit of my beauty.

11:00.240 --> 11:01.920
You are right.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.200
You are so extraordinary.

11:03.280 --> 11:05.400
But I'm not good at painting.

11:05.480 --> 11:07.200
I couldn't draw a bit of your beauty.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.000
But don't worry.

11:09.560 --> 11:11.120
I will practice more in the future.

11:11.200 --> 11:12.160
When I get home,

11:12.240 --> 11:13.440
I'll make another painting

11:13.520 --> 11:14.560
based on your look today.

11:14.640 --> 11:15.560
No!

11:15.640 --> 11:16.840
There is no need to.

11:17.600 --> 11:19.320
Lord Changheng has become a mortal.

11:19.400 --> 11:20.800
His personality has changed a lot,

11:20.880 --> 11:22.600
but he is still so gentle.

11:22.680 --> 11:23.680
I'm being unreasonable,

11:23.760 --> 11:25.520
but he isn't angry at all.

11:25.600 --> 11:28.280
I will have to continue to annoy him.

11:31.080 --> 11:33.600
I've been tired all day.

11:33.680 --> 11:34.840
I'm exhausted.

11:34.920 --> 11:35.800
I can't walk anymore.

11:35.880 --> 11:36.960
Let me massage my feet.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.040
It's so comfortable.

11:44.160 --> 11:46.880
He is sure to dislike me now.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.520
I used to think that I was uninhibited.

11:53.160 --> 11:55.200
But you are the one who truly is.

11:59.120 --> 12:00.080
Wonderful.

12:00.840 --> 12:01.680
How satisfying.

12:01.760 --> 12:03.840
No, I must go there.

12:04.360 --> 12:05.440
My lord.

12:10.800 --> 12:11.920
Xiao Run must not be killed.

12:12.000 --> 12:13.480
Please think twice, my lord.

12:13.560 --> 12:15.600
Who said I wanted to kill him?

12:19.400 --> 12:20.800
She is fearful.

12:20.880 --> 12:22.600
She can't even act.

12:22.680 --> 12:24.200
We can't count on her.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.720
Making Xiao Run lose interest

12:28.440 --> 12:30.120
will have to be up to me.

12:32.520 --> 12:33.440
My lord.

12:41.880 --> 12:44.440
You are indeed extraordinary

12:44.920 --> 12:46.400
like a fairy out of this world.

12:47.880 --> 12:48.840
To be honest…

12:53.920 --> 12:55.960
This may offend you,

12:56.040 --> 12:57.240
but I have to say it.

12:58.280 --> 13:00.920
I keep getting the feeling

13:01.000 --> 13:03.840
that you and I are destined
to be together.

13:04.560 --> 13:05.680
There you are, honey.

13:05.760 --> 13:06.800
I've been looking for you.

13:07.680 --> 13:08.680
Mr. Dongfang?

13:10.120 --> 13:11.520
Big Blockhead.

13:11.600 --> 13:12.920
Why did you come too?

13:22.400 --> 13:23.440
What are you doing?

13:24.000 --> 13:25.640
The floor is cold. Be careful, honey.

13:30.600 --> 13:31.640
Don't move.

13:47.400 --> 13:48.360
Don't move.

13:49.960 --> 13:52.120
Mr. Dongfang, how could you do this?

13:54.280 --> 13:56.160
My wife has been married to me
for three years.

13:56.720 --> 13:57.920
Who is married to you?

14:05.080 --> 14:07.960
Honey, why are you still angry with me?

14:08.040 --> 14:09.320
I…

14:10.040 --> 14:11.520
You're pregnant.

14:11.600 --> 14:12.960
It is hard on you.

14:13.040 --> 14:14.400
I shouldn't have made you angry.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.680
I know I was wrong.

14:17.280 --> 14:18.440
You're pregnant.

14:18.520 --> 14:20.400
You shouldn't eat too many bowls of ice.

14:20.480 --> 14:21.920
I was too anxious,

14:22.000 --> 14:23.280
so I said those harsh words.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.440
After our child is born,

14:25.520 --> 14:27.520
I'll take you all over Lucheng

14:27.600 --> 14:29.680
and let you eat whatever you want.

14:40.160 --> 14:41.680
You've gone too far.

14:42.880 --> 14:44.320
Being married is ridiculous enough.

14:44.400 --> 14:46.120
But you even claim that I'm pregnant.

14:46.200 --> 14:47.480
Not even Jieli could come up

14:47.560 --> 14:49.520
with such a terrible lie.

14:49.600 --> 14:51.120
How can you make Xiao Run give up

14:51.760 --> 14:53.440
without something so outrageous?

14:53.520 --> 14:54.640
This is too much.

14:54.720 --> 14:55.640
Look at him.

14:57.520 --> 14:59.400
Do you already feel sorry for him?

14:59.480 --> 15:00.320
I don't.

15:02.520 --> 15:03.440
Let's go, honey.

15:03.520 --> 15:04.760
Let's go home.

15:25.920 --> 15:26.800
That's right.

15:35.760 --> 15:36.600
Xiao Run.

15:37.240 --> 15:38.720
We are friends.

15:38.800 --> 15:40.880
I didn't want to bring up the past.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.680
I thought that if you couldn't find her,

15:42.760 --> 15:44.480
you would give up after a few days.

15:44.560 --> 15:45.440
To my surprise,

15:45.520 --> 15:47.240
my wife got angry with me today,

15:47.320 --> 15:48.600
so she agreed to your invitation

15:48.680 --> 15:50.040
and caused this misunderstanding.

15:51.000 --> 15:51.840
I…

15:51.920 --> 15:53.280
I won't blame the ignorant.

15:53.360 --> 15:55.120
Give the painting of my wife back.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.920
Honey, let's go.

16:42.800 --> 16:44.120
We've gone so far.

16:44.200 --> 16:45.600
Why don't you let me go?

16:45.680 --> 16:47.000
Honey, you are wrong.

16:47.080 --> 16:48.280
If Xiao Run comes after us,

16:48.360 --> 16:49.720
our lie will be exposed.

16:49.800 --> 16:51.240
Who is your wife?

16:51.320 --> 16:52.960
Why are you addicted to acting?

16:55.080 --> 16:57.360
Why are you still mad at me, honey?

16:59.520 --> 17:00.640
Let go of me.

17:05.119 --> 17:06.040
What is that?

17:10.560 --> 17:11.599
Haven't you seen it before?

17:12.720 --> 17:13.720
Come with me.

17:13.800 --> 17:14.680
Wait.

17:16.079 --> 17:18.119
Am I going like this?

17:18.200 --> 17:21.720
Can you help me become beautiful again?

17:34.360 --> 17:35.760
Have you decided yet?

17:38.320 --> 17:39.360
No?

17:43.480 --> 17:46.480
My wish is to destroy Shuiyuntian,

17:47.480 --> 17:50.000
kill all those hypocritical immortals,

17:50.080 --> 17:51.600
and tell my father the good news.

17:54.200 --> 17:56.080
Then I'll unify the three realms

17:56.160 --> 17:57.680
so that the people of Cangyan Sea

17:57.760 --> 18:00.720
will suffer less
from disease, disaster, and harm,

18:00.800 --> 18:02.440
and never suffer the pain of separation.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.240
But I will do these

18:04.840 --> 18:06.880
by myself.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.440
Why do I need to pray
to heaven with a sky lantern?

18:10.880 --> 18:12.080
That should be the case.

18:12.800 --> 18:14.800
Why would I expect anything else from him?

18:21.200 --> 18:22.120
What about you?

18:22.200 --> 18:23.400
Why haven't you written it yet?

18:24.680 --> 18:26.040
I haven't decided yet.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.840
I'm the Supreme Lord of the three realms.

18:32.320 --> 18:33.920
Rather than relying on a sky lantern,

18:34.000 --> 18:35.080
you might as well beg me.

18:35.600 --> 18:37.880
If I am happy, I might fulfill your wish.

18:39.840 --> 18:40.760
Really?

18:40.840 --> 18:42.800
I always keep my word.

18:45.240 --> 18:48.240
My wish is actually very simple.

18:49.480 --> 18:50.560
My wish is simply

18:52.520 --> 18:54.520
for the Wangchuan River to be free of war

18:55.480 --> 18:57.360
and for splendid days without weapons.

19:03.440 --> 19:05.680
You're trying again
to persuade me not to wage war.

19:06.360 --> 19:07.640
For tens of thousands of years,

19:07.720 --> 19:09.800
the Moon Tribe has suffered
the pain of separation and rebellion.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.480
Once the war starts,

19:11.560 --> 19:13.280
be it the Moon Tribe or the Fairy Tribe,

19:13.920 --> 19:15.880
how many tragedies will be repeated?

19:22.040 --> 19:25.000
You don't want Shuiyuntian
to be ravaged by war.

19:25.080 --> 19:28.360
Then what about the pain of betrayal
that my ancestors suffered

19:28.440 --> 19:32.320
and the humiliation
that the people of Cangyan Sea endured?

19:33.160 --> 19:34.680
Cangyan Sea's 100,000 soldiers

19:34.760 --> 19:37.400
have been sealed
in the Xuanxu Realm for 30,000 years.

19:37.480 --> 19:39.440
They are also someone's sons,

19:39.520 --> 19:41.600
husbands, and fathers.

19:41.680 --> 19:43.520
They also want to go home.

19:44.400 --> 19:46.200
I grew up in Shuiyuntian.

19:46.280 --> 19:48.840
And he is the Moon Supreme of Cangyan Sea.

19:49.720 --> 19:52.640
People of the Moon Tribe
and the Fairy Tribe cannot…

19:54.520 --> 19:56.840
I'm sorry, we were having a good time.

19:56.920 --> 19:58.040
Let's not talk about that.

20:02.480 --> 20:03.560
Let's not talk about that.

20:05.200 --> 20:07.320
Let's write our wishes.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.160
All right.

20:30.280 --> 20:31.320
Orchid,

20:32.080 --> 20:33.920
I want you to stay by my side forever.

20:35.600 --> 20:36.800
Big Blockhead,

20:36.880 --> 20:39.280
although I can't stay with you forever,

20:39.960 --> 20:41.760
I hope you will always be safe and happy,

20:42.440 --> 20:44.600
surrounded by friends, brothers,

20:44.680 --> 20:47.320
loyalty, and love,

20:47.400 --> 20:48.760
and never lonely again.

20:51.400 --> 20:54.640
THE BRIGHT MOON SHINES OVER THE SEA

20:54.720 --> 20:57.840
FROM AFAR
WE SHARE THIS MOMENT TOGETHER

21:19.400 --> 21:21.960
Wanqing, think about it some more.

21:22.040 --> 21:23.720
I've made up my mind.

21:23.800 --> 21:25.120
You don't have to persuade me.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.880
Lady Wanqing.

21:31.680 --> 21:33.080
Lady Orchid, you're here.

21:35.000 --> 21:36.400
What's going on?

21:37.040 --> 21:38.160
Lady Orchid,

21:38.240 --> 21:39.560
as you said,

21:39.640 --> 21:41.280
the Dark Golden Glory blossomed

21:41.360 --> 21:43.480
just when I made up my mind.

21:43.560 --> 21:45.520
This is a good omen.

21:47.960 --> 21:49.000
These are the assets

21:49.080 --> 21:51.840
that I have accumulated over ten years
at Flying Immortal Pavilion.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.320
Look at this luminous pearl.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.600
Isn't it beautiful?

21:57.720 --> 21:58.920
Yes,

21:59.000 --> 22:00.160
it is.

22:00.240 --> 22:02.120
I've used the assets that I saved

22:02.200 --> 22:03.240
to buy my freedom.

22:03.760 --> 22:05.800
From now on, I am free.

22:05.880 --> 22:08.040
I can go in search of my dream lover.

22:08.600 --> 22:09.760
What?

22:09.840 --> 22:10.680
Is that why…

22:10.760 --> 22:11.800
Yes.

22:12.280 --> 22:13.200
But…

22:14.360 --> 22:16.200
But you don't know

22:16.280 --> 22:18.200
whether he likes you or not.

22:19.120 --> 22:20.320
That's right.

22:20.400 --> 22:22.160
If you don't leave yourself a way out,

22:22.240 --> 22:24.000
then even if he takes you,

22:24.080 --> 22:26.760
when your beauty fades
and he loses interest in you later,

22:26.840 --> 22:28.680
you won't have any money
to support yourself.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.400
- Wanqing.
- That's right.

22:31.200 --> 22:32.720
I can't forget the sight of him.

22:32.800 --> 22:33.680
That is enough for me.

22:34.400 --> 22:36.360
Life is short.

22:36.960 --> 22:39.280
Since I'm certain that this fated person

22:39.360 --> 22:40.360
is not a dream,

22:40.440 --> 22:41.640
then no matter what,

22:42.120 --> 22:43.920
I don't want to leave any regrets.

22:46.320 --> 22:47.160
From now on,

22:47.240 --> 22:48.640
I won't have any valuable flowers

22:48.720 --> 22:50.240
for you to look after.

22:50.880 --> 22:52.000
Don't say that.

22:52.080 --> 22:53.360
We are friends.

22:53.920 --> 22:55.880
Hearing you say that

22:55.960 --> 22:57.320
makes me glad to have met you.

23:00.840 --> 23:01.680
But…

23:22.360 --> 23:23.680
Has he not given up yet?

23:37.720 --> 23:38.640
Mr. Dongfang.

23:39.560 --> 23:40.640
After I got home yesterday

23:41.360 --> 23:43.280
and thought about the huge mistake
I almost made,

23:43.760 --> 23:44.840
I couldn't sleep at night.

23:44.920 --> 23:46.760
I'm here to ask for your forgiveness.

23:47.640 --> 23:49.240
This is water under the bridge.

23:49.320 --> 23:50.360
Don't mention it again.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.400
I can't.

23:51.960 --> 23:54.440
The face and figure
of the fairy in the painting

23:54.520 --> 23:56.160
continue to linger in my mind.

23:56.760 --> 23:57.920
I'm afraid

23:58.720 --> 24:01.200
I'll never meet another
who will stir my heart so.

24:02.160 --> 24:03.160
But don't get me wrong.

24:03.720 --> 24:05.400
I may be a playboy,

24:06.160 --> 24:07.800
but I will never steal another man's love.

24:08.360 --> 24:10.040
I promise, from now on,

24:10.120 --> 24:12.200
I will never appear
in front of your wife again.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.960
I've decided

24:22.040 --> 24:23.640
to leave this sad place

24:24.920 --> 24:26.320
to garrison the border in the north.

24:26.880 --> 24:27.800
What?

24:27.880 --> 24:29.080
Once I leave,

24:29.160 --> 24:30.480
I'm afraid I won't be able

24:31.680 --> 24:33.680
to play cuju, play chess, drink, and chat

24:33.760 --> 24:36.360
with you for several years.

24:37.000 --> 24:38.760
For several years?

24:43.240 --> 24:44.880
If Xiao Run leaves Lucheng,

24:45.560 --> 24:46.560
how can he and Xie Wanqing

24:46.640 --> 24:48.520
get married during the Flower Festival?

24:49.080 --> 24:51.200
Xiao Run, it's getting late.

24:51.280 --> 24:52.520
We have to get on the road.

24:55.880 --> 24:56.720
Mr. Dongfang.

24:58.000 --> 24:58.920
Take care.

25:05.400 --> 25:06.240
Wait.

25:16.360 --> 25:18.120
These two are mortals now,

25:18.200 --> 25:20.000
but they're still so troublesome.

25:21.560 --> 25:23.920
We have to part eventually.

25:24.000 --> 25:26.120
Let us bid farewell here.

25:33.080 --> 25:34.640
Xiao…

25:34.720 --> 25:35.960
Xiao Run,

25:36.040 --> 25:37.960
are you really leaving?

25:39.880 --> 25:41.440
I somehow think

25:42.080 --> 25:43.840
that I should give this stone

25:43.920 --> 25:45.040
to my destined one.

25:45.680 --> 25:46.760
But fate plays cruel tricks.

25:46.840 --> 25:47.960
Mr. Dongfang and Lady Orchid

25:48.040 --> 25:49.040
are the perfect match.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.880
But I'm very grateful

25:52.960 --> 25:54.680
that you came to see me off today.

25:55.280 --> 25:56.920
I heard that the northern prairie is vast.

25:57.520 --> 25:58.760
Maybe seeing the beautiful view

25:58.840 --> 26:00.120
might lessen my sorrow.

26:06.040 --> 26:07.520
Do something.

26:07.600 --> 26:09.520
It's all your fault.

26:12.120 --> 26:13.160
Well…

26:15.560 --> 26:16.800
Then…

26:17.960 --> 26:19.600
There is nothing to see

26:19.680 --> 26:21.240
in the cold and harsh frontier.

26:21.320 --> 26:23.240
Xiao Run, it was just a misunderstanding.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.680
I don't blame you anymore.

26:24.760 --> 26:26.600
Don't be impulsive.

26:26.680 --> 26:27.560
Yes.

26:27.640 --> 26:29.880
I know you don't want me to leave.

26:32.520 --> 26:33.680
But I've made up my mind.

26:46.360 --> 26:48.680
Xiao Run, why don't you reconsider?

26:55.000 --> 26:57.000
Xiao Run, if we delay any longer,

26:57.080 --> 26:59.040
we won't reach
the courier station by nightfall.

27:01.360 --> 27:02.360
I see.

27:05.960 --> 27:09.640
I have only known you for a short time.

27:09.720 --> 27:11.440
But for 18 years,

27:11.520 --> 27:13.840
these few days have been
the happiest time of my life.

27:13.920 --> 27:14.880
In the future,

27:15.760 --> 27:17.120
if you experience snow in Lucheng

27:17.200 --> 27:18.400
or wind from the north,

27:19.520 --> 27:21.480
it must be because I am missing you all.

27:22.520 --> 27:23.680
Goodbye.

27:28.280 --> 27:29.360
Jieli.

27:29.440 --> 27:30.680
Hurry.

27:31.480 --> 27:32.480
What should we do? Go.

27:32.560 --> 27:33.920
I'm thinking.

27:34.000 --> 27:35.720
- Jieli.
- I'm thinking.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.400
I'm thinking.

27:39.200 --> 27:40.760
- Hurry.
- I'm thinking.

27:42.720 --> 27:44.440
He's leaving, Jieli.

27:45.440 --> 27:47.480
Have you figured it out, Jieli?

27:47.560 --> 27:48.840
Xiao Run!

27:52.680 --> 27:53.840
Congratulations.

27:53.920 --> 27:54.840
You passed the test.

27:56.680 --> 27:57.560
Test?

28:04.960 --> 28:06.960
Let me introduce her to you again.

28:07.040 --> 28:08.720
Lady Orchid

28:08.800 --> 28:12.920
is the biological sister of Mr. Dongfang.

28:22.320 --> 28:24.120
As her elder brother,

28:24.200 --> 28:26.840
Mr. Dongfang treats Lady Orchid
like a treasure.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.040
Xiao Run,

28:28.120 --> 28:29.880
you claimed that you love Lady Orchid,

28:29.960 --> 28:31.400
but you acted so absurdly.

28:31.480 --> 28:34.360
You even posted paintings
all over Lucheng.

28:34.440 --> 28:35.600
For such a strange thing,

28:35.680 --> 28:37.280
of course my lord

28:37.360 --> 28:38.720
couldn't let his sister marry you.

28:38.800 --> 28:40.760
So we came up with a plan

28:40.840 --> 28:41.920
for them to act like a couple

28:42.000 --> 28:43.200
to see how you would handle it.

28:49.840 --> 28:51.200
But today,

28:51.280 --> 28:54.160
you came up with such a perfect solution.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.560
It not only

28:56.520 --> 28:59.200
measures up to your love for Lady Orchid,

28:59.280 --> 29:02.400
but it also preserves your friendship
with Mr. Dongfang.

29:03.280 --> 29:04.360
It is clear to see

29:04.440 --> 29:06.520
that your personality and character

29:06.600 --> 29:07.520
are impeccable.

29:09.400 --> 29:11.280
Mr. Dongfang, isn't that right?

29:16.000 --> 29:17.240
Yes.

29:23.600 --> 29:25.280
Are you really siblings?

29:27.880 --> 29:28.880
Yes.

29:31.160 --> 29:34.120
What is the test?

29:34.200 --> 29:35.400
Fool.

29:35.480 --> 29:36.320
It means

29:36.400 --> 29:38.560
that you are allowed to marry Lady Orchid.

29:46.680 --> 29:48.480
My brother-in-law, please accept my bow.

29:50.200 --> 29:51.200
You…

29:51.680 --> 29:53.440
Aren't you going to garrison the north?

29:54.880 --> 29:55.880
I'm not going anywhere.

30:01.240 --> 30:02.680
Don't get cocky too soon.

30:03.200 --> 30:05.240
You keep saying you like Orchid.

30:07.280 --> 30:08.640
You like my sister.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.040
Do you know what love is?

30:10.120 --> 30:11.120
How will you prove it?

30:12.440 --> 30:15.960
I feel very close with Lady Orchid.

30:16.040 --> 30:17.560
I seem to have seen her somewhere.

30:18.920 --> 30:20.320
That doesn't count.

30:20.400 --> 30:22.560
Aren't parents and siblings close too?

30:24.360 --> 30:25.520
That's right.

30:25.600 --> 30:27.680
The moment I saw Qu Shui,
I felt close to him too.

30:27.760 --> 30:30.000
I feel like I've seen him somewhere.

30:31.640 --> 30:34.240
I will treat Lady Orchid very well,

30:34.320 --> 30:35.800
cherish her, and protect her.

30:35.880 --> 30:37.200
I won't let anyone bully her.

30:37.280 --> 30:39.720
I can handle that on my own.

30:40.280 --> 30:41.120
Yes.

30:41.680 --> 30:44.440
Mr. Dongfang and Lady Orchid are close.

30:44.520 --> 30:46.280
Of course I'm no match.

30:46.360 --> 30:49.000
Are these insincere speeches all you know?

30:54.920 --> 30:56.360
To be honest,

30:56.440 --> 30:57.880
I have lived carefree

30:57.960 --> 30:59.360
over the years.

30:59.440 --> 31:01.760
I always felt that I was
the happiest person in the world.

31:01.840 --> 31:04.040
Being spanked and lectured

31:04.120 --> 31:05.800
were inconsequential to me.

31:05.880 --> 31:06.760
That was until I…

31:11.240 --> 31:14.840
That was until I dreamed of Lady Orchid.

31:15.880 --> 31:16.920
I couldn't find her.

31:17.000 --> 31:18.080
I kept searching

31:18.160 --> 31:20.400
and couldn't stop thinking about her.

31:22.760 --> 31:24.600
That day when Mr. Dongfang tested me

31:24.680 --> 31:27.360
and I thought that I had
no chance with Lady Orchid in this life,

31:27.440 --> 31:28.840
I felt empty inside.

31:33.800 --> 31:35.160
Lady Orchid, your makeup today

31:35.240 --> 31:36.640
is refreshing and elegant.

31:36.720 --> 31:38.040
The day we met,

31:38.120 --> 31:39.120
it must have been a test.

31:39.760 --> 31:41.120
But everything I said that day

31:41.200 --> 31:42.200
was sincere.

31:43.280 --> 31:44.720
Whatever you want in the future--

31:44.800 --> 31:45.960
Enough.

31:47.720 --> 31:48.560
My lord.

31:53.160 --> 31:55.040
It's inappropriate to talk about this now.

31:56.280 --> 31:57.360
I'll go home,

31:57.440 --> 31:59.520
inform my father,
and prepare betrothal gifts.

32:01.680 --> 32:02.680
Leave now.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.000
Yes.

32:04.560 --> 32:05.680
Let's go.

32:08.400 --> 32:09.520
Look at what you've done.

32:09.600 --> 32:10.920
Do something about it.

32:11.000 --> 32:12.000
- What do we do?
- My lord.

32:12.080 --> 32:13.080
I don't know.

32:38.360 --> 32:40.120
I have the same feeling.

32:40.760 --> 32:43.360
Is this love?

33:01.040 --> 33:03.440
My lord, all 3,000 guards are here.

33:03.520 --> 33:04.760
No one escaped.

33:41.240 --> 33:43.240
Don't look so sad.

33:45.920 --> 33:48.000
My lord, here. Have some grapes.

33:48.080 --> 33:49.480
Eat it yourself.

33:50.280 --> 33:52.640
You won't get any
when you are towing boats at Silver Lake.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.200
What are you talking about?

33:54.280 --> 33:55.480
Why would I be doing that?

33:56.080 --> 33:58.440
The current situation is great.

33:59.360 --> 34:00.360
Great?

34:00.880 --> 34:02.320
Even I can see it.

34:03.120 --> 34:04.040
It's all ruined.

34:05.320 --> 34:06.880
Jieli.

34:06.960 --> 34:08.760
What should we do now?

34:08.840 --> 34:11.000
Xiao Run is busy
preparing betrothal gifts to marry me.

34:11.080 --> 34:13.280
Lady Wanqing is determined
to buy her freedom

34:13.360 --> 34:14.520
and marry Moon Supreme Lord.

34:15.639 --> 34:17.760
What should we do?

34:17.840 --> 34:18.679
Everything now

34:18.760 --> 34:21.320
is still going according to the fate poem.

34:21.400 --> 34:23.520
She meets her beloved
during the Lantern Festival

34:23.600 --> 34:25.280
and buys her freedom to get married.

34:25.360 --> 34:28.920
Next is the wedding ceremony
during the Flower Festival.

34:29.000 --> 34:31.560
She dies at the sword
of the groom, Xiao Run.

34:31.639 --> 34:33.480
But she wants to marry me,

34:33.560 --> 34:34.520
not Xiao Run.

34:34.600 --> 34:37.120
Yes, the groom is not Xiao Run.

34:37.199 --> 34:39.400
I know.

34:39.480 --> 34:40.840
Calm down.

34:40.920 --> 34:43.520
Everyone is being too narrow-minded.

34:43.600 --> 34:44.840
Here's what I mean.

34:45.320 --> 34:48.400
What if there are two weddings
during the Flower Festival?

34:55.320 --> 34:56.480
Do you mean…

34:57.040 --> 34:58.080
Seven words.

34:58.160 --> 35:01.120
Steal the beam to replace the pillar.

35:01.200 --> 35:03.800
Orchid, agree to marry Xiao Run.

35:03.880 --> 35:06.440
The lord will agree to marry Xie Wanqing.

35:07.000 --> 35:09.960
We will prepare the weddings together.

35:10.040 --> 35:12.080
On the wedding night
during the Flower Festival,

35:12.640 --> 35:14.520
we will make a swap.

35:19.600 --> 35:20.520
Jieli.

35:20.600 --> 35:22.240
I've known you for over 1,000 years.

35:22.320 --> 35:23.920
I knew you were immoral,

35:24.000 --> 35:25.800
but I didn't know it was to this extent.

35:27.440 --> 35:28.400
You flatter me.

35:29.640 --> 35:30.760
Will this work?

35:31.840 --> 35:34.400
The bride and groom are all fake.

35:34.480 --> 35:35.960
Why not?

35:36.040 --> 35:37.960
We just need to follow the fate poem.

35:38.040 --> 35:39.040
On the wedding night,

35:39.120 --> 35:41.160
as long as Xiao Run kills Xie Wanqing,

35:41.240 --> 35:42.600
then they will pass their tribulations.

35:42.680 --> 35:43.840
The details aren't important.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.680
I won't allow it.

35:50.760 --> 35:52.600
Marriage is not child's play.

35:55.000 --> 35:56.320
My lord objects.

35:56.400 --> 35:58.280
So I object too.

36:01.080 --> 36:02.640
Do you have any of your own opinions?

36:05.560 --> 36:06.920
My lord,

36:07.000 --> 36:09.240
there is no alternative though.

36:13.880 --> 36:14.880
I agree.

36:19.360 --> 36:20.880
Although the process is different,

36:20.960 --> 36:22.280
as long as the result

36:22.360 --> 36:23.760
matches the fate poem,

36:23.840 --> 36:25.320
the tribulation will be completed.

36:25.400 --> 36:26.400
It can work.

36:27.160 --> 36:29.600
Didn't you just say it was immoral?

36:29.680 --> 36:30.640
I…

36:32.480 --> 36:33.840
Isn't the most important thing now

36:33.920 --> 36:35.880
to ensure Lord Changheng and Lady Chidi

36:35.960 --> 36:37.600
successfully pass their tribulations

36:37.680 --> 36:40.240
and keep their primordial spirits safe?

36:40.320 --> 36:41.920
As long as we can achieve this goal,

36:42.000 --> 36:43.760
we can take unconventional measures.

36:43.840 --> 36:45.480
The Flower Festival is coming up.

36:45.560 --> 36:47.440
Moon Supreme Lord, tomorrow…

36:48.280 --> 36:49.480
No, today,

36:49.560 --> 36:50.640
take betrothal gifts

36:50.720 --> 36:52.160
to propose to Lady Wanqing.

37:01.680 --> 37:03.400
Don't forget that it's all fake.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.120
Fake.

37:06.560 --> 37:08.360
I don't care if it's fake or not.

37:08.440 --> 37:10.920
I only marry the woman I like.

37:11.000 --> 37:12.320
As for others,

37:12.400 --> 37:13.800
I will not even look at them,

37:13.880 --> 37:15.720
not to mention proposing a marriage.
